# One graceful excursion of GPC $gpc out of the common set and back.
#   script stby-one.script gpc=2
# RUN -> STANDBY is the flight software's own graceful departure (FCMSWMON
# puts out sync code 000, so the set drops the computer rather than voting
# against it; it notices the switch about 1.2 s later).  STANDBY -> RUN
# re-enters initialisation and rejoins the common set in OPS 0, through the
# same AIBGPCLO join a freshly IPL'd computer makes (ledger #175, #259).
# Nothing else is touched for at least 12 s either side of each mode change
# (Program Note 42433; ledger #256).
+0     gpc $gpc
+12    mode STANDBY
+15    mode RUN
wait gpc $gpc mode-tb RUN timeout 300
+60    gpc $gpc
